WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:33.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:34.000 --> 01:35.479
I'm sorry, officer.

3
01:36.000 --> 01:38.640
I promise he won't do it again.

4
01:38.640 --> 01:40.080
Good thing he didn't get physical.

5
01:40.080 --> 01:41.800
Otherwise, this would be a serious matter.

6
01:41.800 --> 01:42.860
Yes, I understand.

7
01:43.000 --> 01:44.860
But his behavior was still wrong.

8
01:45.000 --> 01:46.660
You should apologize to them.

9
01:47.000 --> 01:49.000
Both parties need to sign a public security mediation agreement.

10
01:49.000 --> 01:51.200
What? I have to apologize to a deadbeat?

11
01:52.479 --> 01:54.640
An apology is not enough.

12
01:55.479 --> 01:57.640
Look at how badly my son is hurt.

13
01:57.960 --> 01:59.640
No, we have to sue them.

14
01:59.800 --> 02:01.800
We have to sue. We must sue.

15
02:01.800 --> 02:04.520
We must make him compensate us for emotional distress.

16
02:04.520 --> 02:06.920
As for Zhang Guang's matter, I think...

17
02:07.040 --> 02:07.880
No problem.

18
02:08.520 --> 02:09.639
The police won't file a case,

19
02:09.639 --> 02:11.320
but you two can file a private prosecution.

20
02:11.320 --> 02:12.840
Besides the basic litigation fees,

21
02:12.840 --> 02:13.920
there are attorney fees.

22
02:13.920 --> 02:14.600
The extra cost

23
02:14.600 --> 02:16.000
is the psychiatric evaluation fee.

24
02:16.000 --> 02:17.920
Do the evaluation. We must do it.

25
02:18.520 --> 02:19.120
Just do it.

26
02:19.640 --> 02:21.280
How much can an evaluation cost?

27
02:21.280 --> 02:23.200
About 100,000 yuan should be enough.

28
02:23.200 --> 02:24.079
That much?

29
02:25.000 --> 02:25.600
This...

30
02:26.280 --> 02:27.079
Well...

31
02:28.280 --> 02:29.000
Then we...

32
02:29.400 --> 02:31.260
Actually, an apology is fine too.

33
02:31.400 --> 02:32.320
An apology is fine.

34
02:32.320 --> 02:33.240
Louder.

35
02:33.240 --> 02:36.570
Where's the energy you had when you pulled out the shoehorn?

36
02:36.920 --> 02:38.040
I'm sorry.

37
02:39.760 --> 02:41.920
How was it? Did you enjoy the show?

38
02:42.200 --> 02:44.680
It was interesting. I didn't come for nothing.

39
02:44.680 --> 02:46.560
Remember to pay next time.

40
02:47.920 --> 02:49.180
I'll pay you right now.

41
02:49.560 --> 02:50.120
Here.

42
02:51.200 --> 02:53.280
Your senior partner, little tiger.

43
02:57.200 --> 02:57.930
I'm leaving.

44
03:10.840 --> 03:12.840
What are you doing? Slamming things around.

45
03:12.840 --> 03:15.240
Come on, hand over all your business cards.

46
03:19.040 --> 03:20.700
Then explain it to me, come on.

47
03:21.120 --> 03:23.560
Who appointed you as a senior partner?

48
03:23.560 --> 03:24.400
This title?

49
03:24.560 --> 03:25.640
In hair salons,

50
03:25.640 --> 03:26.680
they have senior Tonys.

51
03:26.680 --> 03:27.680
Isn't it just a title?

52
03:27.680 --> 03:28.680
To ask for a higher price.

53
03:28.680 --> 03:30.560
Is that the same thing?

54
03:31.560 --> 03:32.480
Do you know that

55
03:32.480 --> 03:34.920
if they investigate, my law firm will have to close down?

56
03:34.920 --> 03:36.640
It won't go that far.

57
03:37.560 --> 03:38.120
Also,

58
03:38.400 --> 03:40.930
who gave you the bad idea to block Zhang Guang?

59
03:41.079 --> 03:41.800
When you do this kind of thing,

60
03:41.800 --> 03:43.560
can you discuss it with me a little?

61
03:43.560 --> 03:44.840
Stop nagging, okay?

62
03:44.840 --> 03:46.680
Didn't I just want to help Aunt Fang

63
03:46.680 --> 03:47.680
get her money back quickly?

64
03:47.680 --> 03:50.480
I thought you were worried about your commission.

65
03:50.680 --> 03:52.840
Yes, I am worried about my commission.

66
03:52.840 --> 03:54.240
Is there a problem with that?

67
03:54.240 --> 03:55.400
Wasn't it because your method didn't work

68
03:55.400 --> 03:56.680
that I used some tactics?

69
03:56.680 --> 03:57.560
What tactics?

70
03:57.560 --> 03:58.400
Your tactics are

71
03:58.400 --> 04:00.960
pushing the boundaries of the law, right?

72
04:01.080 --> 04:03.800
No, it won't cause any trouble.

73
04:04.800 --> 04:06.960
Okay, I also think it won't.

74
04:07.240 --> 04:08.300
Then let's do this.

75
04:09.120 --> 04:11.380
Don't get involved in this case anymore.

76
04:11.560 --> 04:12.240
Why?

77
04:12.240 --> 04:13.280
Why shouldn't I get involved?

78
04:13.280 --> 04:14.280
I brought this case in.

79
04:14.280 --> 04:16.079
Okay then, let's share the risk.

80
04:16.240 --> 04:17.680
You owe a share of the legal fees I advanced.

81
04:17.680 --> 04:18.800
Didn't you say I didn't need to?

82
04:18.800 --> 04:19.959
Are you going back on your word now?

83
04:19.959 --> 04:22.240
Yes, I'm going back on my word. So what?

84
04:22.280 --> 04:23.080
No, you...

85
04:24.840 --> 04:27.000
Okay, fine.

86
04:27.000 --> 04:28.240
Just you wait. Fine.

87
04:28.240 --> 04:29.000
I'm waiting.

88
04:39.840 --> 04:40.440
Xiaolong.

89
04:40.840 --> 04:41.400
Dad.

90
04:41.960 --> 04:43.420
Uncle Li, you're here too.

91
04:44.280 --> 04:45.560
Just took the car out for a spin,

92
04:45.560 --> 04:46.960
took him for a ride on the way,

93
04:46.960 --> 04:49.360
and then I'll pick you up to go home tonight.

94
04:49.400 --> 04:50.080
Car?

95
04:50.120 --> 04:51.840
Who did you steal the car from this time?

96
04:51.840 --> 04:52.840
What do you mean steal?

97
04:52.840 --> 04:54.120
It's all legal.

98
04:54.120 --> 04:55.400
Look at how smug he is.

99
04:55.400 --> 04:56.800
Uncle Ermao at the second-hand market

100
04:56.800 --> 04:58.000
found him a job.

101
04:58.560 --> 05:00.120
Doing sales, right?

102
05:00.680 --> 05:01.400
No,

103
05:02.000 --> 05:04.400
why do you always swallow words when you speak?

104
05:04.400 --> 05:05.260
Swallow words?

105
05:05.560 --> 05:06.560
Sales manager.

106
05:07.080 --> 05:08.680
My dad is Manager Xiao now.

107
05:08.680 --> 05:11.080
He should be smug. He'll be smug for a while, right?

108
05:11.080 --> 05:12.120
Well, you stay here.

109
05:12.120 --> 05:13.560
Show him around,

110
05:13.560 --> 05:14.960
and I'll go down to inspect.

111
05:14.960 --> 05:15.800
Where are you going to inspect?

112
05:15.800 --> 05:17.000
Don't scratch the car.

113
05:17.000 --> 05:18.000
No, impossible.

114
05:19.120 --> 05:19.840
Xiaolong.

115
05:20.560 --> 05:22.840
I have to say, you've set this up really well.

116
05:22.840 --> 05:25.000
Small as it is, it has everything.

117
05:25.000 --> 05:25.520
Yes.

118
05:25.520 --> 05:28.120
I feel a strong sense of righteousness.

119
05:28.120 --> 05:29.560
Do you know why, Dad Li?

120
05:30.000 --> 05:31.840
Because of this Sword of Justice.

121
05:31.840 --> 05:33.360
The Sword of Justice you wrote.

122
05:33.360 --> 05:34.890
I'm in the center position.

123
05:38.280 --> 05:39.120
Hey, kid.

124
05:39.840 --> 05:40.800
When you're done wiping,

125
05:40.800 --> 05:42.680
help me wipe this car too.

126
05:50.800 --> 05:53.240
Didn't you go undercover

127
05:53.240 --> 05:54.680
for that case before?

128
05:54.680 --> 05:56.800
Why are you still here?

129
05:56.800 --> 05:57.800
Where else would I be?

130
05:57.800 --> 05:59.130
This bathhouse is mine.

131
06:00.120 --> 06:01.450
This is your bathhouse?

132
06:03.600 --> 06:04.240
Look at you.

133
06:04.240 --> 06:06.160
You even have a business.

134
06:06.720 --> 06:07.720
A small business.

135
06:08.000 --> 06:10.130
Then why do you keep running upstairs?

136
06:11.040 --> 06:12.800
Wait, isn't your case over yet?

137
06:13.160 --> 06:14.800
Yes, the case is over,

138
06:14.800 --> 06:15.920
but I'm not done with her.

139
06:15.920 --> 06:16.800
What?

140
06:19.000 --> 06:20.720
Didn't you say there's nothing between you two?

141
06:20.720 --> 06:21.920
It's not what you think.

142
06:21.920 --> 06:23.120
What do I think?

143
06:23.120 --> 06:23.560
Let me tell you,

144
06:23.560 --> 06:24.240
no matter what,

145
06:24.240 --> 06:26.240
if you two keep hanging out like this,

146
06:26.240 --> 06:26.920
over time,

147
06:26.920 --> 06:27.240
what if...

148
06:27.240 --> 06:28.720
You're not trying to say we'll fall in love over time, are you?

149
06:28.720 --> 06:29.920
See, you said it yourself.

150
06:29.920 --> 06:30.800
What do you mean I said it myself?

151
06:30.800 --> 06:32.260
You were leading me there.

152
06:34.000 --> 06:34.800
Jun, don't worry.

153
06:34.800 --> 06:38.240
Whether it's our values or our looks,

154
06:38.240 --> 06:39.560
we're incompatible in every way.

155
06:39.560 --> 06:41.000
We can't possibly fall in love.

156
06:41.000 --> 06:42.560
Growing maggots is more likely.

157
06:42.560 --> 06:44.560
If you're a man, swear on it.

158
06:44.560 --> 06:45.360
Fine, I'll swear.

159
06:45.360 --> 06:46.360
Jun, watch me.

160
06:46.560 --> 06:47.560
If we ever get together,

161
06:47.560 --> 06:49.360
may my guts rot and my feet fester.

162
06:49.360 --> 06:50.600
May I never make money in this life,

163
06:50.600 --> 06:51.860
and be a dog in the next.

164
06:53.600 --> 06:54.159
See?

165
06:54.159 --> 06:55.820
I resonate with you, you know?

166
06:56.840 --> 06:58.159
Okay, remember this from now on.

167
06:58.159 --> 07:00.280
You can't even make eye contact with my daughter,

168
07:00.280 --> 07:01.120
let alone spark anything.

169
07:01.120 --> 07:02.000
Spark what?

170
07:02.000 --> 07:02.480
Impossible.

171
07:02.480 --> 07:04.720
Sparks are the biggest taboo in a bathhouse.

172
07:04.720 --> 07:05.840
Can I wash your car now?

173
07:05.840 --> 07:06.640
Let me wash it.

174
07:06.720 --> 07:07.850
I'll wash it for you.

175
07:08.000 --> 07:09.360
This car is too old.

176
07:09.840 --> 07:10.480
What do you mean?

177
07:10.480 --> 07:11.840
It's an old car,

178
07:11.840 --> 07:13.100
so it matches an old...

179
07:14.040 --> 07:15.120
an old hero.

180
07:15.240 --> 07:16.240
You weren't trying to say 'old geezer', were you?

181
07:16.240 --> 07:16.920
No, no.

182
07:17.240 --> 07:19.100
Old headlights. Old headlights.

183
07:20.120 --> 07:20.920
Right here.

184
07:25.800 --> 07:27.400
Sir, who are you looking for?

185
07:27.800 --> 07:29.130
That's him. That's him.

186
07:29.680 --> 07:30.360
Sir, you can't go in.

187
07:30.360 --> 07:31.000
I'm looking for someone. I'm looking for someone, sir.

188
07:31.000 --> 07:31.720
Wang Ruoqi.

189
07:32.680 --> 07:34.280
Where is Wang Ruoqi?

190
07:34.840 --> 07:35.800
Come out, Wang Ruoqi!

191
07:35.800 --> 07:37.260
Sir, sir, let's calm down.

192
07:37.280 --> 07:37.600
Don't touch me.

193
07:37.600 --> 07:38.480
Can I help you?

194
07:38.480 --> 07:39.840
Look, what are you doing?

195
07:39.840 --> 07:40.680
It's broken.

196
07:41.920 --> 07:43.360
Lawyers,

197
07:43.720 --> 07:46.040
Wang Ruoqi introduced me to a crappy house.

198
07:46.040 --> 07:47.800
The bathroom leaked and wasn't fixed.

199
07:47.800 --> 07:48.840
I fell and broke my arm.

200
07:48.840 --> 07:49.920
A comminuted fracture.

201
07:49.920 --> 07:51.360
The house I lent you

202
07:51.360 --> 07:52.480
was well-maintained.

203
07:52.480 --> 07:54.140
There shouldn't be any leaks.

204
07:54.240 --> 07:55.400
Are you trying to extort me?

205
07:55.400 --> 07:56.680
Extort? You think I'm extorting her?

206
07:56.680 --> 07:57.680
If your house was fine,

207
07:57.680 --> 07:58.720
would my husband's arm be like this?

208
07:58.720 --> 07:59.240
That's not what I meant.

209
07:59.240 --> 08:00.360
Didn't you say

210
08:00.360 --> 08:02.040
this house belongs to your friend, right?

211
08:02.040 --> 08:02.920
My friend's.

212
08:02.920 --> 08:04.280
Liar. Look.

213
08:04.680 --> 08:06.010
I brought the evidence.

214
08:06.360 --> 08:08.280
It's written in black and white on this contract.

215
08:08.280 --> 08:09.720
The landlord is Wang Binghui.

216
08:09.720 --> 08:10.160
Look.

217
08:10.160 --> 08:12.240
Who is Wang Binghui? Is he your father?

218
08:12.240 --> 08:13.400
Don't go too far.

219
08:13.400 --> 08:14.360
I kindly helped you.

220
08:14.360 --> 08:15.600
Why are you biting the hand that feeds you?

221
08:15.600 --> 08:16.400
I told you.

222
08:16.400 --> 08:17.480
Wang Binghui is her father.

223
08:17.480 --> 08:18.240
They teamed up to trick us.

224
08:18.240 --> 08:19.600
Cut the crap.

225
08:19.600 --> 08:20.400
You must compensate me,

226
08:20.400 --> 08:21.680
or I'll sue you in court.

227
08:21.680 --> 08:22.600
I'll sue your whole family.

228
08:22.600 --> 08:23.360
Isn't it just Wang Binghui?

229
08:23.360 --> 08:24.480
Don't get physical. Don't get physical.

230
08:24.480 --> 08:25.360
Is there anyone in charge?

231
08:25.360 --> 08:26.360
Mr. Ma, Mrs. Ma.

232
08:27.000 --> 08:28.280
Attorney Li, you're just in time.

233
08:28.280 --> 08:29.720
Can you solve this?

234
08:29.920 --> 08:31.040
Such a severe injury?

235
08:31.040 --> 08:32.039
Are you in charge?

236
08:32.120 --> 08:32.720
Yes, yes.

237
08:32.720 --> 08:34.000
Lanya, Meeting Room 1.

238
08:34.000 --> 08:34.400
Okay.

239
08:37.679 --> 08:39.010
Please calm down first.

240
08:39.240 --> 08:42.679
You can tell me your demands.

241
08:42.679 --> 08:44.210
I'll figure something out.

242
08:45.040 --> 08:45.920
Mr. Li.

243
08:46.600 --> 08:49.120
My husband and I are not unreasonable people.

244
08:49.120 --> 08:50.720
But look at my husband's arm.

245
08:51.240 --> 08:52.720
He's so badly injured.

246
08:52.720 --> 08:55.480
For lost wages, medical bills,

247
08:55.680 --> 08:56.720
and emotional distress,

248
08:56.720 --> 08:58.400
you have to give us some compensation.

249
08:58.400 --> 08:59.240
No problem.

250
08:59.720 --> 09:02.000
How much do you want?

251
09:05.400 --> 09:06.400
At least 500,000.

252
09:09.720 --> 09:12.040
For an intern lawyer,

253
09:12.040 --> 09:13.640
isn't 500,000 a bit too much?

254
09:13.680 --> 09:15.140
Is this price negotiable?

255
09:15.280 --> 09:18.240
Mr. Li, doesn't she have a house?

256
09:18.480 --> 09:19.240
If she can't afford it,

257
09:19.240 --> 09:20.720
she can just sell the house.

258
09:20.720 --> 09:22.120
The house belongs to her father,

259
09:22.120 --> 09:22.920
not hers.

260
09:22.920 --> 09:23.920
She can't make the decision, right?

261
09:23.920 --> 09:25.680
I don't care if she can make the decision or not.

262
09:25.680 --> 09:27.160
It has nothing to do with us.

263
09:27.160 --> 09:28.240
If she doesn't pay,

264
09:28.360 --> 09:30.120
we'll defend our rights and go to court.

265
09:30.120 --> 09:31.680
We have nothing to lose.

266
09:31.680 --> 09:32.840
Honghu is famous, right?

267
09:32.840 --> 09:34.700
I'll make you famous nationwide.

268
09:35.120 --> 09:35.680
500,000.

269
09:35.680 --> 09:36.720
Not a penny less.

270
09:36.720 --> 09:39.240
Okay, then let's not just make Honghu famous.

271
09:39.240 --> 09:40.480
Let's get famous together.

272
09:40.480 --> 09:43.360
Mr. Ma, look up and look over there.

273
09:44.120 --> 09:46.240
There are two surveillance cameras in this room.

274
09:46.240 --> 09:48.680
Everything you two just said

275
09:48.680 --> 09:49.920
has been recorded in 360 degrees.

276
09:49.920 --> 09:51.400
With the purpose of illegal possession,

277
09:51.400 --> 09:53.800
fabricating facts or exaggerating losses,

278
09:53.800 --> 09:54.840
and coercing others to pay

279
09:54.840 --> 09:57.040
obviously unreasonable high compensation.

280
09:57.040 --> 09:57.800
Mr. Ma,

281
09:57.920 --> 10:00.480
you may be suspected of extortion.

282
10:02.120 --> 10:02.600
Come.

283
10:04.120 --> 10:05.240
And here are the corporate bills

284
10:05.240 --> 10:07.360
you two provided to the bank.

285
10:07.480 --> 10:08.600
But combined with your

286
10:08.600 --> 10:10.480
personal spending records,

287
10:10.600 --> 10:12.240
I reasonably suspect that you two

288
10:12.240 --> 10:15.480
did not use the bank loan for business operations.

289
10:15.720 --> 10:18.520
You are suspected of loan fraud and embezzlement.

290
10:19.960 --> 10:20.360
Mr. Ma,

291
10:21.600 --> 10:22.520
at this stage,

292
10:22.520 --> 10:24.840
let's not bother a legal intern.

293
10:25.400 --> 10:27.360
Hurry up and find yourself a lawyer.

294
10:27.360 --> 10:28.720
We are at the law firm now,

295
10:28.720 --> 10:29.720
so it's convenient.

296
10:29.720 --> 10:31.840
If you have any questions, you can ask Attorney Guo.

297
10:31.840 --> 10:32.480
Okay.

298
10:34.000 --> 10:34.360
No.

299
10:40.960 --> 10:41.560
Lawyer Li.

300
10:42.600 --> 10:43.240
Lawyer Li.

301
10:45.720 --> 10:48.240
Did you realize something was wrong with them a long time ago?

302
10:48.240 --> 10:50.600
What? Are you blaming me for not warning you earlier?

303
10:50.600 --> 10:53.060
You did warn me to pay attention to the risks.

304
10:53.240 --> 10:55.970
But I didn't expect them to be this kind of people.

305
10:56.120 --> 10:57.480
You can never truly know someone.

306
10:57.480 --> 10:59.010
The devil is in the details.

307
10:59.480 --> 11:01.840
Think about when you met the couple before.

308
11:01.840 --> 11:03.440
Was there anything unusual?

309
11:04.040 --> 11:07.160
The family is in this situation, but she...

310
11:09.480 --> 11:10.720
I know, Master.

311
11:12.880 --> 11:14.840
I told you not to call me Master.

312
11:24.600 --> 11:25.330
Sister Pang.

313
11:25.480 --> 11:26.210
You're back.

314
11:31.720 --> 11:32.240
What?

315
11:32.840 --> 11:34.120
You saw Lawyer Xiao.

316
11:34.120 --> 11:35.600
Why didn't you say hello?

317
11:36.480 --> 11:38.240
I didn't see him. Is he here?

318
11:38.600 --> 11:39.860
Do you have cataracts?

319
11:41.840 --> 11:43.480
How is your case going?

320
11:43.600 --> 11:44.840
I'm working on it.

321
11:44.960 --> 11:45.600
I was just about to

322
11:45.600 --> 11:47.240
have them report to me.

323
11:47.600 --> 11:48.600
I find that you really

324
11:48.600 --> 11:51.260
can't stand seeing me idle for a moment, can you?

325
12:03.600 --> 12:04.360
Yes, I am.

326
12:08.240 --> 12:08.720
Okay.

327
12:08.960 --> 12:10.090
I'll be right there.

328
12:10.480 --> 12:10.960
Okay.

329
12:11.240 --> 12:12.240
What's wrong, sis?

330
12:12.240 --> 12:12.840
Well,

331
12:13.240 --> 12:14.360
the neighborhood committee called me

332
12:14.360 --> 12:15.480
and said the bank sent debt collectors

333
12:15.480 --> 12:16.840
to kick Aunt Fang and the others out.

334
12:16.840 --> 12:18.120
I need to go there right away.

335
12:18.120 --> 12:19.480
Then I'll go with you.

336
12:19.480 --> 12:20.240
No need.

337
12:20.240 --> 12:21.480
I'll just go by myself.

338
12:21.480 --> 12:22.360
Drive safely.

339
12:22.360 --> 12:23.240
Don't rush.

340
12:40.600 --> 12:41.360
Get in.

341
12:58.960 --> 12:59.760
Grandma Fang,

342
13:00.000 --> 13:02.000
What happened? Did they kick you out?

343
13:02.000 --> 13:03.200
I'll call the police.

344
13:05.120 --> 13:06.840
We left voluntarily.

345
13:07.840 --> 13:10.600
We owe money. We can't deny it.

346
13:12.000 --> 13:13.240
Then let's go.

347
13:13.240 --> 13:14.240
Come with me. Let's go.

348
13:14.240 --> 13:15.240
Where to?

349
13:15.600 --> 13:17.600
Stay at my place for a few days. Let's go.

350
13:17.600 --> 13:19.360
It's fine. It's really fine, Grandma. No.

351
13:19.360 --> 13:20.000
It's really fine.

352
13:20.000 --> 13:20.840
Lawyer Xiao,

353
13:21.840 --> 13:24.240
I appreciate your kindness.

354
13:24.720 --> 13:26.600
Even if I die on the street,

355
13:26.960 --> 13:28.840
I can't die in your house.

356
13:29.000 --> 13:30.480
Don't say that. Let's go, Grandma.

357
13:30.480 --> 13:31.000
No.

358
13:31.000 --> 13:31.960
Let's go. Listen to me.

359
13:31.960 --> 13:33.120
I know a place.

360
13:33.840 --> 13:35.000
Fifty yuan a day.

361
13:35.720 --> 13:37.380
I have a friend working there.

362
13:39.680 --> 13:40.000
Yes.

363
13:40.400 --> 13:40.730
Yeah.

364
13:43.720 --> 13:44.980
I'm leaving, brother.

365
13:45.000 --> 13:45.860
Bye, take care.

366
14:02.600 --> 14:03.360
How is it?

367
14:03.600 --> 14:04.360
He's asleep.

368
14:04.360 --> 14:04.840
Good.

369
14:05.480 --> 14:07.480
Auntie, the paperwork is all done.

370
14:14.120 --> 14:16.250
You guys have really helped me so much.

371
14:16.720 --> 14:18.000
I don't know how to repay you.

372
14:18.000 --> 14:20.360
Aunt Fang, let's not say such things.

373
14:20.360 --> 14:21.480
After all this trouble,

374
14:21.480 --> 14:23.120
Grandma will definitely need to rest for a while.

375
14:23.120 --> 14:24.240
Anyway, if anything happens,

376
14:24.240 --> 14:25.840
let me know immediately.

377
14:28.240 --> 14:29.700
Thank you, Attorney Xiao.

378
14:29.960 --> 14:31.240
Thank you, Attorney Dong.

379
14:31.240 --> 14:31.960
Aunt Fang,

380
14:31.960 --> 14:34.240
I have to go back and prepare the materials for the second trial.

381
14:34.240 --> 14:35.240
Let's close the case as soon as possible.

382
14:35.240 --> 14:37.360
You should spend more time with Grandma.

383
14:37.360 --> 14:38.360
Please.

384
14:38.480 --> 14:39.360
It's my duty.

385
14:42.600 --> 14:43.360
Well,

386
14:44.600 --> 14:46.960
thank you for this.

387
14:47.600 --> 14:48.360
For what?

388
14:50.720 --> 14:51.600
It's nothing.

389
14:52.840 --> 14:54.360
I'll drive.

390
15:02.480 --> 15:04.720
Director, the house issue has been settled.

391
15:04.720 --> 15:06.520
They will move out within a week.

392
15:06.720 --> 15:07.920
I'm sorry, Director.

393
15:08.360 --> 15:10.120
I didn't handle this well.

394
15:10.240 --> 15:11.360
I told you before,

395
15:11.600 --> 15:13.000
when you come to Honghu for an internship,

396
15:13.000 --> 15:14.800
you need to control your temper.

397
15:15.600 --> 15:17.240
Look at the trouble you caused.

398
15:17.240 --> 15:20.360
Fortunately, Lawyer Li covered for you today.

399
15:21.840 --> 15:24.240
Mr. Li, I'm sorry for the trouble.

400
15:24.600 --> 15:26.960
Her internship ends here.

401
15:28.240 --> 15:29.300
No need to keep her.

402
15:38.720 --> 15:39.450
How did it go?

403
15:45.120 --> 15:45.600
Well...

404
15:46.000 --> 15:49.060
If it doesn't work out, the three of us can go talk to him.

405
15:54.360 --> 15:55.120
Director, it's like this.

406
15:55.120 --> 15:56.840
Please don't be mad just yet.

407
15:57.240 --> 15:58.840
This might not be a bad thing.

408
15:59.000 --> 16:00.120
As for Attorney Wang, recently,

409
16:00.120 --> 16:02.360
she has been very motivated and hardworking.

410
16:02.360 --> 16:03.480
Of course, as a newcomer,

411
16:03.480 --> 16:06.940
it's inevitable for her to misjudge society and human nature.

412
16:07.120 --> 16:08.360
But a real lesson

413
16:09.120 --> 16:10.120
is often more effective than verbal preaching,

414
16:10.120 --> 16:12.380
leaving a deeper and more direct impact.

415
16:12.440 --> 16:13.760
So I believe in the future,

416
16:13.760 --> 16:15.890
she won't make the same mistake again.

417
16:19.600 --> 16:20.600
Never again.

418
16:21.600 --> 16:22.760
Thank you, Mentor.

419
16:24.720 --> 16:25.920
Thank you, Director.

420
16:26.480 --> 16:27.240
You scared me to death.

421
16:27.240 --> 16:28.600
Are you kidding me?

422
16:29.360 --> 16:31.480
Ruoqi, welcome aboard officially.

423
16:36.240 --> 16:37.300
Want some milk tea?

424
16:37.480 --> 16:38.810
Jasmine green milk tea.

425
16:39.240 --> 16:40.240
I'll have one too.

426
16:40.240 --> 16:41.900
Anything is fine, less sugar.

427
16:42.600 --> 16:43.360
Me too.

428
17:17.000 --> 17:18.720
I remember putting it here.

429
17:18.720 --> 17:19.599
Look carefully again.

430
17:19.599 --> 17:20.240
Mom, don't worry.

431
17:20.240 --> 17:21.480
Check this inner pocket.

432
17:21.480 --> 17:22.599
Is it in the inner pocket, Dad?

433
17:22.599 --> 17:23.119
I've checked everywhere.

434
17:23.119 --> 17:24.319
Did you put it in yours?

435
17:24.319 --> 17:25.839
Could we have left it at home?

436
17:25.839 --> 17:27.119
I really put it in.

437
17:27.599 --> 17:28.840
Mom, this is bad.

438
17:29.000 --> 17:30.360
Did you drop it on the way

439
17:30.480 --> 17:32.120
when you were taking something out?

440
17:32.120 --> 17:33.360
Don't worry.

441
17:33.360 --> 17:35.960
Do you still remember the bank account number?

442
17:41.600 --> 17:42.360
I'm sorry

443
17:42.360 --> 17:43.760
for holding everyone up.

444
17:43.840 --> 17:46.720
Can we use my wife's card instead?

445
17:47.240 --> 17:48.000
I'm sorry.

446
17:48.120 --> 17:50.250
The property owners are your parents.

447
17:51.000 --> 17:52.360
The remaining balance from the house auction

448
17:52.360 --> 17:55.020
can only be transferred to the owners' account.

449
17:55.400 --> 17:58.000
So could one of you please go back and get it?

450
17:59.120 --> 18:00.000
We can wait.

451
18:02.360 --> 18:03.600
Then, Mom, I'll go back and look for it.

452
18:03.600 --> 18:04.600
Don't worry.

453
18:04.600 --> 18:05.130
Go ahead.

454
18:06.000 --> 18:07.000
Look carefully.

455
18:08.840 --> 18:09.600
Mr. Ma,

456
18:10.360 --> 18:11.000
could you please

457
18:11.000 --> 18:13.120
make a copy of your parents' ID cards?

458
18:13.240 --> 18:14.640
You brought them, right?

459
18:14.840 --> 18:15.360
Yes.

460
18:15.360 --> 18:16.600
I have them here.

461
18:16.600 --> 18:17.930
I'll go make the copies.

462
18:19.320 --> 18:21.000
What an act.

463
18:26.480 --> 18:27.360
Sir, ma'am.

464
18:27.360 --> 18:29.620
After this money goes into your account,

465
18:29.840 --> 18:31.040
you must keep it safe.

466
18:31.480 --> 18:33.000
Don't make the same mistake again.

467
18:33.000 --> 18:35.720
Otherwise, the money you worked hard to save all your life

468
18:35.720 --> 18:38.440
might end up with your children, right?

469
18:39.240 --> 18:41.440
We won't.

470
18:41.440 --> 18:42.240
Sir, ma'am,

471
18:42.800 --> 18:45.920
you must listen to Lawyer Li.

472
18:46.000 --> 18:46.720
We will.

473
18:46.960 --> 18:48.960
Don't give this money to anyone in the future.

474
18:48.960 --> 18:49.280
Yes.

475
18:50.000 --> 18:52.200
Children will have their own fortunes.

476
18:52.240 --> 18:53.840
You can't help them forever.

477
18:54.240 --> 18:55.000
Yes.

478
18:59.920 --> 19:01.480
Why did you bump into me?

479
19:01.480 --> 19:03.000
Why would I bump into you?

480
19:03.000 --> 19:03.760
They were playing pool.

481
19:03.760 --> 19:04.800
Why would I bump into you like that?

482
19:04.800 --> 19:05.680
Why were you standing behind them?

483
19:05.680 --> 19:07.000
You lost. I'm not playing anymore.

484
19:07.000 --> 19:07.920
Don't cheat.

485
19:07.920 --> 19:08.680
Why would I cheat?

486
19:08.680 --> 19:09.960
Xiaolong, come here.

487
19:10.160 --> 19:12.000
Your dad cheats even when playing pool.

488
19:12.000 --> 19:12.560
Hurry up.

489
19:12.760 --> 19:13.280
I won't play with her.

490
19:13.280 --> 19:14.800
If you get help, I'll get help too.

491
19:14.800 --> 19:16.000
Xin, come here.

492
19:16.040 --> 19:16.480
Come.

493
19:16.960 --> 19:18.420
You're just in time. Come.

494
19:19.480 --> 19:21.000
Look at our Xiaolong's style.

495
19:21.000 --> 19:22.000
I taught her.

496
19:22.000 --> 19:23.260
Look at my godson, Xin.

497
19:24.240 --> 19:27.000
Hurry up. You're the referee. Set up the balls.

498
19:28.480 --> 19:29.760
It won't go in.

499
19:31.520 --> 19:32.760
How's your case going?

500
19:32.760 --> 19:34.820
Go ask that Su Qian'er from your team.

501
19:36.240 --> 19:38.640
With him around, the case is delayed again.

502
19:39.520 --> 19:41.240
The bank took the house back.

503
19:41.480 --> 19:44.160
Now my client and her mom don't even have a home.

504
19:45.240 --> 19:46.200
That's his job.

505
19:46.240 --> 19:47.720
He's just doing his job.

506
19:47.760 --> 19:50.000
It may just be a job to you,

507
19:50.720 --> 19:52.200
but to my clients,

508
19:52.200 --> 19:54.130
it's the first half of their lives.

509
19:55.040 --> 19:57.680
I feel sorry for what your clients went through,

510
19:57.680 --> 19:58.680
but lawyers

511
19:59.000 --> 20:01.800
have no obligation to bear moral responsibility.

512
20:02.240 --> 20:04.240
The law is the baseline of morality.

513
20:04.520 --> 20:07.320
You can't hold yourself to the baseline every day.

514
20:07.400 --> 20:08.520
The law also says

515
20:08.520 --> 20:09.480
you can't walk on the street naked.

516
20:09.480 --> 20:10.720
Does that mean you wear briefs

517
20:10.720 --> 20:11.520
on the street every day?

518
20:11.520 --> 20:13.000
You're confusing the issue.

519
20:13.000 --> 20:13.800
Anyway,

520
20:14.080 --> 20:16.200
you better manage your team well,

521
20:16.200 --> 20:17.480
especially that Su Qian'er.

522
20:17.480 --> 20:20.480
Don't take every dirty case. It'll shorten your life.

523
20:20.560 --> 20:22.400
You better manage your team well too.

524
20:22.400 --> 20:23.920
Your law firm is like a zoo.

525
20:24.240 --> 20:27.000
He prints 'Senior Partner' on his business card.

526
20:27.040 --> 20:28.000
Does he have the qualifications?

527
20:28.000 --> 20:30.400
Don't get your law firm's license revoked.

528
20:30.720 --> 20:32.200
How did he get into your law firm?

529
20:32.200 --> 20:33.530
Mind your own business.

530
20:34.280 --> 20:37.200
Anyway, I'll deal with Su Qian'er first.

531
20:38.200 --> 20:39.530
After I'm done with him,

532
20:41.920 --> 20:43.240
I'll deal with you.

533
20:43.800 --> 20:46.130
Your Honor, I have new evidence to submit.

534
20:51.160 --> 20:54.040
The transfer records between Fang Huilan and Wang Lijuan show

535
20:54.040 --> 20:55.400
that there were

536
20:55.400 --> 20:57.240
continuous large loan records between the two parties,

537
20:57.240 --> 20:59.160
as well as a repayment record of 500,000.

538
20:59.160 --> 21:01.240
The last loan of two million

539
21:01.240 --> 21:04.440
was obtained by the appellee mortgaging her property,

540
21:04.480 --> 21:05.480
and the IOU

541
21:05.480 --> 21:07.280
clearly stipulated the loan interest.

542
21:07.280 --> 21:09.040
Therefore, there is reason to suspect

543
21:09.040 --> 21:10.800
that Fang Huilan is a professional moneylender,

544
21:10.800 --> 21:12.720
constituting the crime of illegal business operations.

545
21:12.720 --> 21:13.560
We believe

546
21:13.720 --> 21:15.160
that a lawful judgment must never

547
21:15.160 --> 21:16.440
protect such illegal interests.

548
21:16.440 --> 21:17.560
You're talking nonsense, you little side-part.

549
21:17.560 --> 21:19.040
You have no conscience saying that, you know?

550
21:19.040 --> 21:20.770
Observers, please keep quiet.

551
21:23.280 --> 21:24.000
My statements

552
21:24.000 --> 21:26.000
are all supported by the evidence

553
21:26.000 --> 21:26.960
you provided in the first instance.

554
21:26.960 --> 21:28.440
Your statements will not affect

555
21:28.440 --> 21:31.040
the focus of the dispute and the trial result of this case.

556
21:31.040 --> 21:33.000
It's entirely an excuse to delay the judicial process

557
21:33.000 --> 21:35.460
and help Wang Lijuan avoid paying her debts.

558
21:35.760 --> 21:39.290
Your Honor, I apply to submit supplementary evidence in court.

559
21:56.160 --> 21:57.440
What happened to the old lady?

560
21:57.440 --> 21:58.160
Yeah,

561
21:58.160 --> 21:59.720
it's all ruined like this.

562
22:02.720 --> 22:04.280
It's really hard to watch.

563
22:04.480 --> 22:08.160
The footage shows the tragic situation caused by Wang Lijuan's failure to repay her debt,

564
22:08.160 --> 22:09.560
forcing Fang Huilan and her mother,

565
22:09.560 --> 22:11.400
after the bank loan expired,

566
22:11.400 --> 22:13.520
to move out of their old house.

567
22:13.920 --> 22:15.000
What's more unfortunate is that

568
22:15.000 --> 22:17.280
not long ago, Fang Huilan's mother,

569
22:17.280 --> 22:19.240
due to this series of blows,

570
22:19.560 --> 22:21.040
suffered a worsening condition,

571
22:21.040 --> 22:22.480
and had to stay in a nursing home,

572
22:22.480 --> 22:24.440
living a displaced life.

573
22:24.480 --> 22:27.760
And Fang Huilan herself, due to poor health,

574
22:28.240 --> 22:30.040
is unable to appear in court today.

575
22:30.040 --> 22:31.100
I would like to ask,

576
22:32.200 --> 22:35.660
who has ever seen a professional moneylender end up like this?

577
22:36.400 --> 22:37.000
Your Honor,

578
22:37.000 --> 22:39.200
I think the evidence provided by the opposing counsel

579
22:39.200 --> 22:41.240
and whether Fang Huilan is a professional moneylender

580
22:41.240 --> 22:42.160
have no causal link.

581
22:42.160 --> 22:42.920
Your Honor,

582
22:42.920 --> 22:45.160
in the written evidence I just provided,

583
22:45.160 --> 22:46.560
Fang Huilan's retirement certificate,

584
22:46.560 --> 22:49.560
monthly fixed pension payment records, etc.,

585
22:49.560 --> 22:50.400
can all prove

586
22:50.400 --> 22:52.520
that she has a legal source of income,

587
22:52.560 --> 22:54.040
and that in her bank account,

588
22:54.040 --> 22:56.000
there is no lending profit income,

589
22:56.000 --> 22:57.240
which is enough to prove

590
22:57.240 --> 23:00.200
that Fang Huilan herself is not a professional moneylender.

591
23:00.200 --> 23:01.560
And the footage just shown

592
23:01.560 --> 23:04.160
further proves that the other party's failure to repay the debt

593
23:04.160 --> 23:06.760
has caused serious consequences to my client.

594
23:06.920 --> 23:09.160
Is this the ending a kind, honest,

595
23:09.160 --> 23:11.040
and innocent person deserves?

596
23:12.240 --> 23:15.000
Appellant, do you have anything new to add?

597
23:16.440 --> 23:17.200
No.

598
23:17.200 --> 23:18.000
I do.

599
23:19.240 --> 23:20.440
I hope everyone

600
23:21.240 --> 23:22.560
can firmly remember

601
23:23.160 --> 23:24.240
the footage just now,

602
23:24.240 --> 23:27.000
showing Fang Huilan's family living on the streets.

603
23:27.000 --> 23:28.440
Think carefully about it.

604
23:28.440 --> 23:29.280
A good person,

605
23:29.480 --> 23:31.480
why would she end up like this today?

606
23:32.160 --> 23:33.760
Is it because she is too kind?

607
23:34.240 --> 23:37.800
I believe the law should protect kind people.

608
23:38.400 --> 23:40.720
If morality cannot restrain people's hearts,

609
23:40.720 --> 23:42.380
then the law should be allowed

610
23:43.240 --> 23:45.170
to become the last line of defense.

611
23:45.440 --> 23:46.480
Well said.

612
23:47.920 --> 23:50.000
That's so intense.

613
23:50.720 --> 23:51.520
All rise.

614
23:54.240 --> 23:56.400
The facts found in the trial are clear,

615
23:56.520 --> 23:57.960
and the application of the law is correct.

616
23:57.960 --> 23:59.280
The judgment of this court is

617
23:59.280 --> 24:02.340
to dismiss the appeal and uphold the original verdict.

618
24:23.480 --> 24:25.340
Are you looking for Grandma Fang?

619
24:25.560 --> 24:26.960
She had a sudden heart attack this morning

620
24:26.960 --> 24:28.820
and was sent to a nearby hospital.

621
24:46.520 --> 24:47.280
Aunt Fang.

622
24:48.000 --> 24:49.240
The verdict is out.

623
24:50.200 --> 24:51.000
We won.

624
25:00.720 --> 25:01.800
Lawyer Xiao.

625
25:03.440 --> 25:04.240
Thank you.

626
25:04.560 --> 25:05.520
It's my duty. You're welcome.

627
25:05.520 --> 25:06.720
Thank you all.

628
25:11.520 --> 25:12.240
Doctor.

629
25:15.240 --> 25:16.000
I'm sorry.

630
25:16.440 --> 25:17.560
We did our best.

631
25:36.640 --> 25:38.400
Aunt Fang, Aunt Fang.

632
25:58.320 --> 25:59.280
Aunt Fang.

633
26:00.280 --> 26:01.210
My condolences.

634
26:04.280 --> 26:05.360
My mom,

635
26:06.520 --> 26:09.000
she wouldn't have died so early.

636
26:11.080 --> 26:12.840
It's all because of me.

637
26:17.000 --> 26:19.080
I just wanted to help people.

638
26:20.520 --> 26:25.760
Why did it end up like this?

639
26:37.360 --> 26:39.160
This world is too unfair.

640
27:03.200 --> 27:07.080
Who hasn't trusted the wrong person in their life?

641
27:07.480 --> 27:13.080
Please take good care of this case.

642
27:36.040 --> 27:36.920
Zhang Guang.

643
27:38.560 --> 27:41.080
I received the invitation you sent me.

644
27:41.880 --> 27:43.160
Well, the thing is...

645
27:43.160 --> 27:45.760
I have to go out of town for a trial this weekend.

646
27:46.160 --> 27:47.720
Right, I won't be going.

647
27:47.720 --> 27:49.160
Yeah. Okay, okay.

648
27:52.960 --> 27:53.640
Come in.

649
27:53.760 --> 27:54.490
Attorney Li.

650
27:54.760 --> 27:56.520
The case file is ready.

651
27:59.080 --> 28:00.920
You don't even try when you lie.

652
28:00.920 --> 28:02.450
Who has a trial on a weekend?

653
28:03.640 --> 28:05.000
My classmate Zhang Guang.

654
28:05.000 --> 28:05.760
He got engaged.

655
28:05.760 --> 28:06.760
I don't want to go.

656
28:08.280 --> 28:09.740
The one who owes you money?

657
28:11.920 --> 28:13.960
He really handled that poorly.

658
28:14.000 --> 28:16.200
I figured I'd just cut contact with him.

659
28:18.680 --> 28:20.540
Send me a copy of that invitation.

660
28:36.760 --> 28:37.640
Today

661
28:37.640 --> 28:40.640
is the engagement day of our Zhang Guang and Xiaona.

662
28:40.720 --> 28:43.680
From now on, our two families are one.

663
28:44.000 --> 28:45.800
Xiaona is like my own daughter.

664
28:47.000 --> 28:48.920
Come, let me toast everyone.

665
28:48.920 --> 28:49.560
Come.

666
28:52.960 --> 28:53.920
So happy.

667
28:55.640 --> 28:56.640
Stop for a moment.

668
28:56.640 --> 28:59.920
I am a judge from the Enforcement Bureau of Anping District People's Court.

669
28:59.920 --> 29:01.720
Who are Wang Lijuan and Zhang Guang?

670
29:01.720 --> 29:03.400
Well, it's a joyous day.

671
29:03.400 --> 29:04.800
And the judge is here too.

672
29:04.840 --> 29:06.080
Let's go outside to talk if there's anything.

673
29:06.080 --> 29:06.760
No need.

674
29:07.280 --> 29:09.610
Are these two properties under your name?

675
29:09.720 --> 29:10.780
It's fine, Auntie.

676
29:11.320 --> 29:12.640
What happened?

677
29:12.720 --> 29:15.400
Girl, let me tell you what happened.

678
29:15.640 --> 29:17.960
Your future mother-in-law and your future husband

679
29:17.960 --> 29:20.160
owe my client three million.

680
29:20.160 --> 29:21.640
Three million.

681
29:21.640 --> 29:24.160
And they refuse to pay it back.

682
29:24.160 --> 29:25.520
What nonsense are you talking about?

683
29:25.520 --> 29:26.920
What do you mean refuse to pay?

684
29:26.920 --> 29:27.720
In-laws, this...

685
29:27.720 --> 29:29.400
Don't listen to their nonsense.

686
29:29.400 --> 29:31.000
Judge, it's like this.

687
29:31.320 --> 29:33.760
I rented out those two houses.

688
29:33.760 --> 29:35.160
I signed a 20-year contract.

689
29:35.160 --> 29:36.760
The rent has long been spent.

690
29:36.760 --> 29:38.440
According to the regulations,

691
29:38.440 --> 29:40.240
doesn't the sale not break the lease?

692
29:40.240 --> 29:41.700
Yes, it's hard to sell now.

693
29:41.720 --> 29:44.160
They have already done property preservation.

694
29:44.160 --> 29:44.920
That is to say,

695
29:44.920 --> 29:47.080
the time you supposedly signed the lease

696
29:47.080 --> 29:48.720
was after the property preservation.

697
29:48.720 --> 29:50.520
This is malicious debt evasion.

698
29:50.720 --> 29:51.960
What is property preservation?

699
29:51.960 --> 29:53.020
Don't understand?

700
29:53.320 --> 29:54.760
I'll explain it to you.

701
29:54.760 --> 29:56.800
Aunt Fang, when Wang Lijuan receives the subpoena,

702
29:56.800 --> 29:58.680
she will definitely try every means not to pay.

703
29:58.680 --> 30:00.400
If we do property preservation,

704
30:00.400 --> 30:02.930
the court will temporarily freeze her assets

705
30:03.040 --> 30:04.480
to prevent her from transferring them.

706
30:04.480 --> 30:06.810
You haven't seen this document, have you?

707
30:08.160 --> 30:10.920
This ruling is different from a subpoena.

708
30:11.040 --> 30:13.280
It has legal effect whether it's served or not.

709
30:13.280 --> 30:15.160
We have already applied for enforcement.

710
30:15.160 --> 30:16.520
You can't be a deadbeat anymore.

711
30:16.520 --> 30:17.280
What is this called?

712
30:17.280 --> 30:18.280
This is called lifting a rock,

713
30:18.280 --> 30:19.880
only to drop it on your own feet.

714
30:19.880 --> 30:20.400
What nonsense are you talking about?

715
30:20.400 --> 30:22.080
Your family even tricked me into believing

716
30:22.080 --> 30:24.000
that you can withdraw housing funds for rent.

717
30:24.000 --> 30:26.200
Turns out you were doing this wicked thing all along.

718
30:26.200 --> 30:28.080
The wedding is off.

719
30:28.200 --> 30:28.880
No, Auntie.

720
30:28.880 --> 30:30.010
Auntie, I was wrong.

721
30:30.400 --> 30:31.800
Nana, please talk to her.

722
30:32.080 --> 30:33.280
Xiaona, Xiaona, Xiaona.

723
30:33.280 --> 30:34.160
It was all my mom's idea.

724
30:34.160 --> 30:34.890
Wang Lijuan,

725
30:35.040 --> 30:35.640
Zhang Guang,

726
30:35.640 --> 30:38.800
because you refused to comply with the court's effective judgment,

727
30:38.800 --> 30:40.440
attempted to obstruct the judicial auction,

728
30:40.440 --> 30:41.200
and showed a bad attitude,

729
30:41.200 --> 30:42.160
this court has decided

730
30:42.160 --> 30:43.000
to impose on you

731
30:43.000 --> 30:45.400
a penalty of 15 days of judicial detention.

732
30:45.560 --> 30:46.320
Oh my god.

733
30:46.320 --> 30:47.320
What a good judge.

734
30:47.400 --> 30:49.400
You really are a great and just official.

735
30:49.400 --> 30:49.860
Well...

736
30:50.000 --> 30:50.680
Um...

737
30:50.680 --> 30:52.800
Can we just not rent the house?

738
30:54.640 --> 30:56.300
What are you doing? Step back.

739
30:56.320 --> 30:58.240
Do you know what obstructing law enforcement is?

740
30:58.240 --> 30:59.200
Who is that?

741
31:04.400 --> 31:05.460
It's fine, Auntie.

742
31:05.640 --> 31:07.700
Just let me know if you need anything.

743
31:07.720 --> 31:09.800
I'm running a law firm now.

744
31:09.800 --> 31:12.130
I just won a case worth over three million.

745
31:12.960 --> 31:16.020
Handling your family's little issue is a piece of cake.

746
31:18.800 --> 31:19.560
Aunt Fang.

747
31:21.280 --> 31:23.000
I made a cross-stitch.

748
31:23.760 --> 31:25.000
It's just a small token of my appreciation.

749
31:25.000 --> 31:26.400
This thing is really hard on the eyes.

750
31:26.400 --> 31:27.040
Yeah.

751
31:27.040 --> 31:28.080
Thank you, Aunt Fang.

752
31:28.080 --> 31:30.160
Dragon, Tiger, Good, Inscribe, Flying, Tiger.

753
31:30.160 --> 31:31.080
No.

754
31:31.720 --> 31:34.560
Dragons flying and phoenixes rising, Tigers roaring with power.

755
31:34.560 --> 31:38.160
Good Seedlings embracing the new, Inscribing merits in bronze.

756
31:38.200 --> 31:39.160
It's read vertically.

757
31:39.160 --> 31:41.620
Aunt Fang embroidered all our names into it.

758
31:42.000 --> 31:43.520
Thank you, Aunt Fang.

759
31:43.520 --> 31:44.320
And here.

760
31:45.720 --> 31:46.920
This is the legal fee.

761
31:47.400 --> 31:50.760
And this is the money Lawyer Xiao advanced for me.

762
31:51.520 --> 31:52.880
It's 350,000 in total.

763
31:53.560 --> 31:55.320
Don't think I'm old-fashioned.

764
31:55.320 --> 31:58.760
We old people always feel more secure with cash.

765
31:59.000 --> 32:00.200
Not only is it secure,

766
32:00.560 --> 32:01.680
it's also solid.

767
32:02.960 --> 32:03.560
Miaomiao,

768
32:04.000 --> 32:05.260
get the money counter.

769
32:11.640 --> 32:13.800
Aunt Fang, this 50,000

770
32:13.800 --> 32:15.260
is what I advanced for you,

771
32:15.920 --> 32:18.520
for the litigation fee, property preservation fee,

772
32:18.520 --> 32:19.920
and the nursing home fee.

773
32:20.200 --> 32:21.730
As for the rest of the money,

774
32:22.240 --> 32:23.760
I'll take 100,000 from you,

775
32:23.760 --> 32:26.360
and we'll just count it as the normal legal fee.

776
32:26.560 --> 32:29.200
Girl, what are you doing?

777
32:30.080 --> 32:33.640
What you've done for me can't be repaid with money.

778
32:33.880 --> 32:36.560
Besides, this money was agreed upon long ago.

779
32:36.560 --> 32:38.280
Yeah, wasn't it agreed upon before?

780
32:38.280 --> 32:39.520
You're not showing Auntie any respect, are you?

781
32:39.520 --> 32:41.050
You're looking down on her.

782
32:42.800 --> 32:45.280
Aunt Fang, I'm no saint.

783
32:45.280 --> 32:46.520
I like money too.

784
32:46.880 --> 32:48.040
I have no grudge against money.

785
32:48.040 --> 32:49.800
But after finishing this case,

786
32:50.000 --> 32:51.860
seeing what you've been through,

787
32:51.920 --> 32:54.780
if I put hundreds of thousands of yours in my pocket,

788
32:55.280 --> 32:58.160
I really wouldn't feel at ease spending it.

789
33:16.680 --> 33:19.800
Aunt Fang, I've accepted your legal fee,

790
33:20.320 --> 33:22.080
and I've accepted your gift.

791
33:24.160 --> 33:25.160
From today on,

792
33:25.920 --> 33:27.080
I hope you can

793
33:27.640 --> 33:29.920
start over and live a good life.

794
34:03.160 --> 34:04.490
Your performance bonus

795
34:04.800 --> 34:07.320
will still be 20% of the contingency fee.

796
34:09.880 --> 34:11.800
Then I'll take it.

797
34:11.800 --> 34:12.639
Take it.

798
34:14.080 --> 34:14.920
You...

799
34:17.679 --> 34:19.440
Doesn't this make it a 40-60 split?

800
34:19.440 --> 34:20.480
And I get the 60.

801
34:20.480 --> 34:21.800
All right, you're slick enough.

802
34:21.800 --> 34:22.920
Cut the act.

803
34:22.920 --> 34:23.800
Come on, just take it.

804
34:23.800 --> 34:26.159
I didn't discuss this with you,

805
34:26.480 --> 34:28.210
so you shouldn't bear the risk.

806
34:28.480 --> 34:29.920
Well, before I was...

807
34:30.520 --> 34:32.040
Since we're not sharing it, fine.

808
34:32.040 --> 34:32.880
Thanks.

809
34:40.440 --> 34:41.500
Put the money away.

810
34:44.400 --> 34:45.159
What?

811
34:45.480 --> 34:48.400
I have to say, you handled this generously.

812
34:48.400 --> 34:50.400
You're so generous that I feel a bit guilty.

813
34:50.400 --> 34:51.960
Since you're being so generous,

814
34:51.960 --> 34:53.480
as a man,

815
34:53.480 --> 34:55.280
I can't be too stingy either.

816
35:05.680 --> 35:07.610
Twenty percent is twenty percent.

817
35:08.160 --> 35:08.920
Dong Beihu,

818
35:09.280 --> 35:10.880
don't be impulsive

819
35:10.880 --> 35:12.160
and refund me the money.

820
35:12.160 --> 35:13.640
When you want shares or money later,

821
35:13.640 --> 35:14.800
you'll have nothing.

822
35:14.800 --> 35:15.800
Don't worry.

823
35:16.680 --> 35:17.800
A hero has no regrets.

824
35:17.800 --> 35:19.680
Yeah, Sister Long. Since Brother Hu is so generous,

825
35:19.680 --> 35:21.160
just keep the money.

826
35:21.240 --> 35:22.040
So cool.

827
35:22.040 --> 35:23.160
Put it away quickly.

828
35:23.160 --> 35:24.800
Close the door. Don't let me see it.

829
35:24.800 --> 35:26.920
If you're so reluctant, take it back.

830
35:26.920 --> 35:27.850
No need. No need.

831
35:28.400 --> 35:28.920
Well,

832
35:28.920 --> 35:31.050
have I passed my probation period now?

833
35:31.200 --> 35:31.800
Yes.

834
35:31.800 --> 35:33.160
But from now on, if anything happens,

835
35:33.160 --> 35:34.360
you must sync with me.

836
35:34.640 --> 35:36.840
Huzi, come down.

837
35:38.320 --> 35:39.450
Let me sync with you.

838
35:39.600 --> 35:40.730
My mom is calling me.

839
35:41.000 --> 35:42.480
I... I heard it too.

840
35:44.840 --> 35:45.770
Welcome aboard.

841
35:54.560 --> 35:55.960
Why did he actually come?

842
35:56.080 --> 35:58.760
Weren't you the one bragging in the group?

843
35:59.440 --> 36:02.160
"Come to me if you have difficulties you can't solve."

844
36:02.160 --> 36:03.360
Didn't you say that yourself?

845
36:03.360 --> 36:05.680
I meant difficulties like lawsuits.

846
36:05.680 --> 36:07.400
You can come to me if you want to sue someone.

847
36:07.400 --> 36:09.000
Why come to me for a job?

848
36:09.000 --> 36:09.960
Am I an agency?

849
36:09.960 --> 36:12.840
Introducing a top student to the law firm

850
36:12.840 --> 36:14.280
is a great thing.

851
36:14.360 --> 36:15.400
What top student?

852
36:15.400 --> 36:16.080
How top?

853
36:16.080 --> 36:17.960
Stop it. Hurry up and pick him up.

854
36:17.960 --> 36:19.560
He's already at the station.

855
36:20.320 --> 36:20.960
I...

856
36:34.400 --> 36:35.440
Are you Luo Zhi?

857
36:38.920 --> 36:39.520
Uncle.

858
36:43.080 --> 36:43.680
Uncle.

859
36:46.480 --> 36:47.540
What are you doing?

860
36:47.920 --> 36:49.320
Uncle, I'm Luo Zhi.

861
36:49.920 --> 36:50.400
You...

862
36:50.520 --> 36:51.560
Are you Luo Zhi?

863
36:52.880 --> 36:53.560
What did you call me?

864
36:53.560 --> 36:54.480
Uncle.

865
36:55.080 --> 36:55.920
Look at us.

866
36:55.920 --> 36:57.450
Who should call whom uncle?

867
36:57.800 --> 36:58.760
I've calculated it.

868
36:58.760 --> 37:00.960
According to seniority, I should call you uncle.

869
37:00.960 --> 37:03.880
Are you that top law student?

870
37:04.080 --> 37:04.520
Yes.

871
37:04.800 --> 37:05.440
Bachelor of Law.

872
37:05.440 --> 37:07.560
Uncle, I brought you some local specialties.

873
37:07.560 --> 37:08.400
Hometown specialties.

874
37:08.400 --> 37:09.960
Mushrooms. They're delicious in chicken stew.

875
37:09.960 --> 37:10.920
Okay, thank you.

876
37:11.080 --> 37:12.920
Uncle also brought you a gift.

877
37:12.920 --> 37:13.840
Here, dumplings.

878
37:13.840 --> 37:14.700
Are you hungry?

879
37:15.480 --> 37:16.480
That's not right.

880
37:16.760 --> 37:17.840
According to our hometown custom,

881
37:17.840 --> 37:19.520
shouldn't it be dumplings for leaving and noodles for arriving?

882
37:19.520 --> 37:20.720
Shouldn't we eat noodles?

883
37:20.720 --> 37:22.520
Right. A top student gets it immediately.

884
37:22.520 --> 37:23.360
Eat them on the train.

885
37:23.360 --> 37:25.290
Uncle will buy you a ticket online.

886
37:25.360 --> 37:25.880
Go.

887
37:27.320 --> 37:29.380
No, I haven't been to the law firm yet.

888
37:30.320 --> 37:31.880
My law firm just opened.

889
37:31.880 --> 37:33.080
I don't need anyone right now.

890
37:33.080 --> 37:33.480
Okay?

891
37:33.480 --> 37:34.400
Go back and wait for news.

892
37:34.400 --> 37:34.840
Go, go.

893
37:34.840 --> 37:36.080
It's fine. I'll just follow you.

894
37:36.080 --> 37:38.400
I'll just learn whatever I can.

895
37:39.080 --> 37:40.400
Let me tell you this.

896
37:40.400 --> 37:41.440
As for my law firm,

897
37:41.440 --> 37:42.800
I'm not the only one in charge now.

898
37:42.800 --> 37:44.000
I also have a partner,

899
37:44.280 --> 37:45.080
a cooperating lawyer.

900
37:45.080 --> 37:46.760
You can't get in without her approval.

901
37:46.760 --> 37:48.760
Otherwise, wouldn't I be abusing my power? Right?

902
37:48.760 --> 37:49.920
You have to understand your uncle.

903
37:49.920 --> 37:51.320
Go back now. Be good.

904
37:51.480 --> 37:52.120
I'm going, I'm going.

905
37:52.120 --> 37:52.480
Then,

906
37:52.560 --> 37:53.320
Uncle, uncle.

907
37:53.320 --> 37:54.320
I understand that.

908
37:54.320 --> 37:55.050
We can just do

909
37:55.480 --> 37:56.610
a formal interview.

910
37:56.840 --> 37:57.840
Don't worry.

911
37:57.840 --> 37:59.240
I have a lot of strengths.

912
37:59.560 --> 38:00.690
I have a good memory,

913
38:00.840 --> 38:02.080
and great perseverance.

914
38:02.080 --> 38:03.520
And I'm never afraid of failure.

915
38:03.520 --> 38:05.480
Look, I've failed the bar exam for five years,

916
38:05.480 --> 38:05.920
but next year...

917
38:05.920 --> 38:07.000
Wait a minute.

918
38:07.280 --> 38:09.080
You haven't even passed the bar exam?

919
38:09.080 --> 38:10.520
But I must try again next year.

920
38:10.520 --> 38:11.680
Don't try again. Just stop.

921
38:11.680 --> 38:13.000
I'll send you a red envelope later.

922
38:13.000 --> 38:14.680
Then you can buy whatever you want to eat.

923
38:14.680 --> 38:15.480
I'm not leaving.

924
38:15.480 --> 38:16.800
Just go, just go.

925
38:16.800 --> 38:17.080
Just go.

926
38:17.080 --> 38:17.940
Later, I'll...

927
38:18.400 --> 38:18.800
Hurry.

928
38:19.480 --> 38:20.840
Go, go, go.

929
38:20.920 --> 38:21.780
Hurry up and go.

930
38:22.200 --> 38:22.760
Go back.

931
38:23.400 --> 38:26.130
Don't look back. If you do, I'll beat you to death.

932
38:28.480 --> 38:29.800
What the hell?

933
38:35.440 --> 38:38.200
I didn't put up banners or make a scene.

934
38:38.520 --> 38:40.480
I'm just here to vent my grievances to everyone.

935
38:40.480 --> 38:41.480
Did I break the law?

936
38:41.480 --> 38:42.280
Mr. Han.

937
38:42.600 --> 38:44.560
Look, making such a scene at our company's entrance

938
38:44.560 --> 38:46.360
really affects our reputation.

939
38:46.400 --> 38:48.280
You think you're in the right, don't you?

940
38:48.280 --> 38:49.520
When I bought the insurance back then,

941
38:49.520 --> 38:50.960
you didn't say anything.

942
38:51.360 --> 38:52.400
Now that it's time to settle the claim,

943
38:52.400 --> 38:54.280
there are all these conditions.

944
38:54.400 --> 38:56.520
What reputation does a company like yours have?

945
38:56.520 --> 38:57.880
Tell your boss

946
38:57.880 --> 39:00.000
that this is the last time I'm coming here.

947
39:00.000 --> 39:01.660
Tell him I'll see him in court.

948
39:01.960 --> 39:02.400
No, no.

949
39:02.400 --> 39:03.320
Mr. Han.

950
39:09.480 --> 39:11.400
Although I haven't passed the bar exam yet,

951
39:11.400 --> 39:13.360
I promise I'll get the certificate this year.

952
39:13.360 --> 39:14.690
Please give me a chance.

953
39:14.880 --> 39:16.320
Where did you pop up from?

954
39:16.560 --> 39:18.160
Didn't I put you on the train?

955
39:18.280 --> 39:19.800
Uncle, I didn't get on the train.

956
39:19.800 --> 39:21.000
I refunded the ticket

957
39:21.200 --> 39:23.400
and used the money to hitch a ride back.

958
39:23.680 --> 39:24.610
Awesome, right?

959
39:25.480 --> 39:27.000
No, I... what I said to you,

960
39:27.000 --> 39:28.860
you didn't take it to heart at all.

961
39:30.000 --> 39:30.960
It has nothing to do with me.

962
39:30.960 --> 39:32.620
He... I didn't ask him to come.

963
39:32.640 --> 39:33.480
He...

964
39:34.480 --> 39:35.840
Luo... Luo Zhi.

965
39:35.960 --> 39:36.160
Luo Zhi.

966
39:36.160 --> 39:36.360
Luo Zhi.

967
39:36.360 --> 39:38.840
Luo Zhi said it has nothing to do with you.

968
39:39.400 --> 39:40.440
But Luo Zhi,

969
39:40.440 --> 39:41.840
your uncle is right.

970
39:42.200 --> 39:44.520
My law firm really doesn't need anyone right now.

971
39:44.520 --> 39:46.800
Hear that? Would your uncle lie to you?

972
39:47.160 --> 39:48.880
Uncle, Lawyer Xiao,

973
39:49.200 --> 39:51.440
I don't want money, and I won't take up space.

974
39:51.440 --> 39:53.000
Just give me a chance to learn.

975
39:53.000 --> 39:54.480
What chance?

976
39:54.480 --> 39:55.840
The chance to sneak back,

977
39:55.840 --> 39:56.520
I shouldn't have given it to you.

978
39:56.520 --> 39:57.160
Just go.

979
39:57.160 --> 39:58.840
Won't take up space? You're as big as two of me.

980
39:58.840 --> 40:00.480
Let me say a few more words to Lawyer Xiao.

981
40:00.480 --> 40:02.080
What else is there to say? This is quite expensive.

982
40:02.080 --> 40:02.760
Lawyer Xiao.

983
40:02.760 --> 40:04.160
I have a very meticulous mind.

984
40:04.160 --> 40:05.400
I'm suited for law.

985
40:05.400 --> 40:05.960
Hurry, go.

986
40:05.960 --> 40:06.960
I'll memorize it.

987
40:07.160 --> 40:08.360
I have a good memory.

988
40:08.360 --> 40:09.890
Hurry up and go be a cashier.

989
40:12.480 --> 40:13.560
Look at you, kid.

990
40:13.760 --> 40:15.480
Why are you working?

991
40:16.280 --> 40:17.480
It's fine, Great-aunt.

992
40:17.480 --> 40:19.210
I figured I should do what I can.

993
40:19.280 --> 40:21.080
I can't just live here for free.

994
40:22.480 --> 40:23.760
What a good boy.

995
40:23.760 --> 40:25.160
I'm just anxious

996
40:25.160 --> 40:27.320
and can't help you with anything.

997
40:27.480 --> 40:30.610
It's fine, Great-aunt. I want to stay at the law firm too,

998
40:30.880 --> 40:32.320
but my uncle is right.

999
40:32.480 --> 40:34.740
We can't use our power for personal gain.

1000
40:34.800 --> 40:36.520
I'll just earn it myself.

1001
40:36.560 --> 40:39.520
Then how do you plan to earn it?

1002
40:50.520 --> 40:51.760
Good morning, Director.

1003
40:51.760 --> 40:52.290
Morning.

1004
40:53.280 --> 40:54.340
What are you doing?

1005
40:54.440 --> 40:56.520
I'm fine. I saw the entrance was a bit dirty.

1006
40:56.520 --> 40:59.520
So I just cleaned it up a bit on my way.

1007
41:00.480 --> 41:01.040
Thank you.

1008
41:01.040 --> 41:02.900
No problem. Good morning, Uncle.

1009
41:03.080 --> 41:03.920
Working hard?

1010
41:06.880 --> 41:09.010
Are you showing off your talents here?

1011
41:09.520 --> 41:11.040
Did you mop the floor with soap?

1012
41:11.040 --> 41:12.520
I almost pulled a muscle.

1013
41:13.520 --> 41:14.280
Alright.

1014
41:14.760 --> 41:16.880
I ran into a case on the road yesterday.

1015
41:16.880 --> 41:18.040
He wants to sue an insurance company.

1016
41:18.040 --> 41:19.480
I've never handled an insurance case before.

1017
41:19.480 --> 41:21.040
It's a good opportunity to expand your business.

1018
41:21.040 --> 41:22.560
The amount is quite large. He'll be here soon.

1019
41:22.560 --> 41:25.000
Regardless of the amount, I have to be responsible to the client.

1020
41:25.000 --> 41:25.860
Are you respo--

1021
41:28.040 --> 41:28.880
Mr. Han.

1022
41:29.120 --> 41:30.000
You've arrived?

1023
41:30.000 --> 41:31.280
Okay, okay. I'll come pick you up.

1024
41:31.280 --> 41:31.840
Okay.

1025
41:32.480 --> 41:33.680
He's here. Get ready.

1026
41:35.920 --> 41:36.920
What's going on?

1027
41:36.920 --> 41:38.250
You'll know in a minute.

1028
41:50.000 --> 41:50.480
Mr. Wei.

1029
41:50.880 --> 41:51.560
Hello, Attorney Li.

1030
41:51.560 --> 41:54.080
This is Xiao Longnü, a lawyer from our firm.

1031
41:54.520 --> 41:55.480
Hello.

1032
41:55.920 --> 41:56.800
Hello.

1033
41:58.520 --> 41:59.520
Here's the thing.

1034
42:00.320 --> 42:03.480
Four years ago, right after our Xinxin was born,

1035
42:04.040 --> 42:05.880
we went to Shengkang Insurance

1036
42:05.880 --> 42:08.320
and bought her that critical illness insurance.

1037
42:08.320 --> 42:09.040
And then...

1038
42:10.320 --> 42:12.480
Last month, the child suddenly...

1039
42:14.320 --> 42:15.780
It's okay. Take your time.

1040
42:16.440 --> 42:19.700
What's the insurance company's reason for the rejection?

1041
42:20.000 --> 42:20.960
They don't meet

1042
42:20.960 --> 42:24.040
the claim conditions of the critical illness insurance contract.

1043
42:24.040 --> 42:25.920
We explained it to the child's parents,

1044
42:25.920 --> 42:27.640
but they wouldn't listen at all.

1045
42:27.640 --> 42:29.160
Several departments of the insurance company

1046
42:29.160 --> 42:30.600
keep passing the buck

1047
42:30.600 --> 42:32.000
back and forth,

1048
42:32.000 --> 42:33.480
and just won't solve it for us.

1049
42:33.480 --> 42:35.000
And they said we were just making a scene.

1050
42:35.000 --> 42:37.530
I personally sympathize with them very much.

1051
42:37.800 --> 42:40.480
But the company must strictly follow the contract.

1052
42:40.480 --> 42:42.160
We can't pay compensation just because they are miserable.

1053
42:42.160 --> 42:44.080
We really have no other choice.

1054
42:44.440 --> 42:45.300
Attorney Xiao.

1055
42:45.840 --> 42:47.400
I beg you to help us.

1056
42:47.560 --> 42:49.400
Attorney Li, please.
